			"notes": "Hello there.\n\nIt's been a long time since I released version 1.8.3.\n\nUnfortunately, I have been busy lately and cannot afford enough time to support old Minecraft versions, which is why I've decided to support only the latest version of Minecraft from now on.\n\nHere are the changes in 1.8.4:\n\n* Fullbright now works by changing the gamma value, not by giving the player a night vision effect.\n* Fixed an issue where toggle sprint was working erratically.\n* Removed NoHurtBobbing because Mojang added this feature to vanilla Minecraft (check accessibility settings)."
		},
